   "title": "Style: genre, tempo, instruments, voice",
   "widgets_values": [
    "Upbeat indie pop at 112 BPM in 4/4 time. Bright jangly electric guitars, punchy live drums, a warm round bass and hand claps in the chorus. A clear female lead vocal sings the verses close and dry, with stacked harmonies in the chorus. Polished, radio-ready mix with a wide stereo image."
   ]
