   "title": "Lyrics with [Verse] / [Chorus] tags",
   "widgets_values": [
    "[Intro - Jangly guitar riff, drums come in]\n\n[Verse 1]\nStreetlights blink on one by one\nI roll the window down and breathe\nThe radio plays a song we knew\nAnd the city hums along with me\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nEvery corner holds a story\nEvery mile, a little more\n\n[Chorus - Stacked harmonies, hand claps]\nWe are driving into morning\nWith the night still in our hair\nNothing planned and nothing owing\nWe will know when we are there\n\n[Verse 2]\nCoffee steam and paper maps\nYour laughter in the passenger seat\nThe highway draws a silver line\nAnd the sunrise keeps the beat\n\n[Chorus - Stacked harmonies, hand claps]\nWe are driving into morning\nWith the night still in our hair\nNothing planned and nothing owing\nWe will know when we are there\n\n[Outro - Guitar riff returns, fades out]"
   ]
  },
