   "title": "Downloads + requirements",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Downloads + requirements\n\nClick a file name to download it. Put it in the folder shown (inside `ComfyUI/models/`).\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | [acestep_v1.5_xl_base_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ACE-Step-1.5/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/acestep_v1.5_xl_base_bf16.safetensors) | 9.97 GB |\n| `text_encoders/` | [qwen_0.6b_ace15.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ACE-Step-1.5/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_0.6b_ace15.safetensors) | 1.19 GB |\n| `text_encoders/` | [qwen_4b_ace15.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ACE-Step-1.5/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_4b_ace15.safetensors) | 8.38 GB |\n| `vae/` | [ace_1.5_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ACE-Step-1.5/resolve/main/split_files/vae/ace_1.5_vae.safetensors) | 0.34 GB |\n\nTotal: about 19.9 GB. All four are the Comfy-Org repackaged files the official template uses. There is no fp8, int8 or GGUF XL file in that repo.\n\n**Optional swap** (second file of the text encoder loader in group 2):\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `text_encoders/` | [qwen_1.7b_ace15.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/ACE-Step-1.5/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_1.7b_ace15.safetensors) | 3.71 GB |\n\nThe 1.7B song planner is less than half the size of the 4B one. One run with it (default song, no VRAM cap): 48 s instead of 56 s, a different song, lyrics still sung. Its VRAM under the cap was not measured. The default stays 4B, as in the template.\n\n**VRAM:** 12 GB target, **not verified on a 12 GB card.** On the 24 GB lab card with ComfyUI started with `--reserve-vram 13.5` (about 10 GiB left for ComfyUI) the whole GPU peaked at 11.1 GiB for 120 s, 11.3 GiB for 240 s and 11.1 GiB for the 60 s instrumental, 0.9 GiB of that held by other programs. Without the cap ComfyUI fills the card (21.6 GiB). The four files are 19.9 GB, so on 12 GB they do not sit in VRAM together: the test machine has 64 GB RAM, less was not tested.\n\n**Run on ComfyUI 0.45.3.** ACE-Step 1.5 XL support came with ComfyUI PR #13317 (April 2026); versions older than 0.45.3 were not tested. **No custom nodes.**\n\nLicence: ACE-Step 1.5 is MIT (the Comfy-Org repackage is marked Apache-2.0). The authors say the music can be used commercially.\n"
   ]
  },
