   "title": "Why two text encoders",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Why two text encoders\n\nThe loader takes two files, as in the official template. `qwen_0.6b_ace15` reads your **Style** and **Lyrics**. `qwen_4b_ace15` is the song planner: a language model that writes audio codes for the whole song before sampling starts (`generate_audio_codes` on the **Song → conditioning** node; ComfyUI's tooltip: slower, better quality). The planner uses the same seed as the sampler.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 21,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
