   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "title": "Why the decode is tiled",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Why the decode is tiled\n\nThe template decodes the whole song in one piece (`VAEDecodeAudio`). With ComfyUI held to about 10 GiB, a 240 s song then peaked at 20.8 GiB on the whole GPU during the decode. `VAEDecodeAudioTiled` (tile 512, overlap 64) kept the same song at 11.3 GiB.\n\nThe two decodes of one song differ by a signal-to-noise ratio of 38 dB at 120 s and 36 dB at 240 s (mp3 against mp3). Not compared by ear.\n"
   ]
  },
